01:03:51.320 --> 01:03:51.900
Of course.

01:03:52.100 --> 01:03:56.810
Well, thank you.

01:04:15.900 --> 01:04:17.160
Why would I dream of something like this?

01:04:17.420 --> 01:04:20.720
It's like I'm being murdered because of my dream.

01:04:20.980 --> 01:04:23.910
That's proof that Maria's ability to communicate has become stronger.

01:04:25.500 --> 01:04:26.940
