01:08:02.332 --> 01:08:05.292
He told me that I have to be a part of the team.

01:08:06.108 --> 01:08:06.988
Me and you.

01:08:07.580 --> 01:08:11.080
Also, if we can work together with the Espers who are still out there...

01:08:11.676 --> 01:08:13.436
