01:08:35.950 --> 01:08:36.470
What's wrong with you?

01:08:36.890 --> 01:08:44.070
Dad, don't hide it anymore.

01:08:46.400 --> 01:08:48.230
I know. About my mom.

01:09:01.436 --> 01:09:03.436
